OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 23 Oct to Sun 1 Nov
OL,6,FChangeable and at times unsettled,
OL,7,Fwith weather systems spreading in from
OL,8,Fthe Atlantic. These will bring spells
OL,9,Fof rain, heavy at times, together with
OL,10,Fa risk of strong winds or gales.
OL,11,FBetween systems it will be drier and
OL,12,Fbrighter with some sunshine, but also
OL,13,Fwith a few showers in places.
OL,14,FTemperatures may be slightly below
OL,15,Fnormal at first, but are likely to
OL,16,Frise above average later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
