OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 2 Nov to Mon 16 Nov
OL,6,FChangeable and at times unsettled,
OL,7,Fwith weather systems spreading in from
OL,8,Fthe Atlantic. These will bring spells
OL,9,Fof rain, heavy at times (especially in
OL,10,Fthe west), together with a risk of
OL,11,Fstrong winds or gales. Between systems
OL,12,Fit will be drier and brighter with
OL,13,Fsome sunshine, but also with a few
OL,14,Fshowers in places. Temperatures are
OL,15,Flikely to be near to or above average
OL,16,Foverall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
